        "created_at": "2023-01-04T20:37:04.234Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Fun watch.</p>\n<p>You guys are getting the rules down a lot better as time goes by.  Only thing that jumped out at me was at 45:00 in.  Those four hindered minions that got hit by the following attack from Starbuck would mostly have been knocked out.  The one that rolled a 5 would have been modified down to a 3 and just barely passed his save, going a d4.  The other three all had modified results of 2 or less and were KO’d immediately.  Multi-hinder plus multi-attack is a brutal minion sweeper combo when you can get it to go off, and even lieutenants don’t like it much.</p>\n<p>Look forward to seeing the next one.</p>",
