        "created_at": "2023-01-04T21:30:55.307Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Thanks!</p>\n<p>Our next game has a pretty complicated super villain battle coming up. There will be lots of boosts and hinders going out. Do you find it troublesome to keep up with multiple effects? The super villain has his own powers like normal, but he can also control the environment so it’s almost like he gets to go twice each round.</p>",
