        "created_at": "2023-01-15T12:21:31.315Z",
        "cooked": "<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=c4uTVLkUBus\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">I see the side session is up over on youtube.</a>  Now I just need to find a couple of hours to listen to it.  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>\n<p>EDIT:  Okay, that was pretty great, especially Kid Fury and the ending twist that I will not spoil.</p>\n<p>Do you still want a rundown on rules flubs?  I hate to do it without invitation at this point, but there were a few, at least one pretty severe.</p>",
